{"name": "All Army Attack", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128840/extras/b652fcf4834f2b60ec39d02ac0635089.poster.avif?t=1794842249\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128840/extras/b652fcf4834f2b60ec39d02ac0635089.webm?t=1794842249\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128840/extras/b652fcf4834f2b60ec39d02ac0635089.mp4?t=1794842249\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><br/><br/>Take on the role of Commander, recruiting unique troops and artillery from a vast pool of cards, defeating enemies, and using the resources gained to develop powerful new units and draft in massive reinforcements.<br/><br/>Build an army from scratch and scale it into hundreds of units in a fast-paced and highly satisfying gameplay loop as you attempt to build an army powerful enough to defeat awesome bosses.<br/><br/>Freely customize and modify your cards and units or craft and mutate every individual soldier to create wildly different builds and strategies in every run. Explore combinations between different characters, factions, cards, and battlefield setups to create devastating armies!<br/><br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"120\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128840/extras/38bfcf015ece2f81bd528ef14d011bbc.avif?t=1794842249\" width=\"1080\"/></span><br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128840/extras/f89e2b0a53f8956345f200fcfbd7de7c.poster.avif?t=1794842249\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128840/extras/f89e2b0a53f8956345f200fcfbd7de7c.webm?t=1794842249\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128840/extras/f89e2b0a53f8956345f200fcfbd7de7c.mp4?t=1794842249\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><br/><br/>Make battlefield judgments like a seasoned general \u2014 or a greedy gambler. Sacrifice or preserve your troops strategically to maximize income from every encounter.<br/><br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"120\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128840/extras/c497684c365c1a193a50d8441a406a86.avif?t=1794842249\" width=\"1080\"/></span><br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128840/extras/1130686d77155b4404b6be24ed138248.poster.avif?t=1794842249\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128840/extras/1130686d77155b4404b6be24ed138248.webm?t=1794842249\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128840/extras/1130686d77155b4404b6be24ed138248.mp4?t=1794842249\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><br/><br/>Different characters and maps each come with their own unique card pools, and every run lets you mix and match them in different ways, creating all kinds of crazy interactions.<br/><br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"120\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128840/extras/173e91eb225f5245b443a37195b4ab6c.avif?t=1794842249\" width=\"1080\"/></span><br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128840/extras/41ecfd6edfb9fa12d23a329fae83252c.poster.avif?t=1794842249\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128840/extras/41ecfd6edfb9fa12d23a329fae83252c.webm?t=1794842249\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128840/extras/41ecfd6edfb9fa12d23a329fae83252c.mp4?t=1794842249\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><br/><br/>Away from the battlefield,\u00a0 you can freely decide how to spend your hard-earned cash across a wide variety of meta-progression systems. Build up your town, strengthen your bonuses, unlock new content \u2014 or even put hats on your characters! Develop things at your own pace and gain all kinds of advantages for your next battle.\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>", "short_desc": "Hold onto your clucks! All Army Attack is a chaotic large-scale roguelike auto-battler. Unite animals and plants, build an army that spills off the screen, gamble it all with every battle, and fight your way toward a formidable cosmic threat!", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128840/743e6d51e433722e5d23cf5edf95683af84904ea/header.jpg?t=1794842249", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Casual", "Strategy", "Auto Battler", "Roguelite", "Turn-Based Tactics", "2D"], "developers": "Blacklight Games", "publishers": "Blacklight Games", "release_date": "2027", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4128840", "review_type": "Recommended", "curator_desc": "16 November 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/ZUKEBm_LVhw", "first_seen": 1794783600.0, "review_rank": 28}